# Svelte / Tauri UI (Pytxo presentation)

- **Svelte 5 Runes only** (`$state`, `$derived`, `$effect`). No legacy Svelte stores for new code.
- **Zero direct filesystem access** in the UI. All state via Tauri v2 IPC event bus.
- Terminal view: ANSI-stripped streams; target smooth ~60 FPS updates without leaking memory.
- Monaco for diffs; xterm.js for terminal rendering.
- Do not embed orchestration logic in the frontend — delegate to Rust core.
